N","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/shield-cn-jr7hrugvf","summary":"Shield CN is a free badge generation tool for developers that creates README badges styled after the shadcn/ui design language. It is available on AllShadcn and was created by Justin Levine.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--j39vRm3d--/f_auto/v1777381630/posts/Jr7HruGVF?_a=BAMAMiWQ0","num_upvotes":36,"num_comments":10,"created_at":"2026-04-28T13:07:10.641Z"},{"id":"bj2gPfPfc","title":"Termcn","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/termcn-bj2gpfpfc","summary":"Termcn is a component library that brings the shadcn/ui design system to terminal user interfaces. Created by Aniket Pawar, it is now listed on AllShadcn.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--A3gBoDAc--/f_auto/v1776688959/posts/bj2gPfPfc?_a=BAMAMiWQ0","num_upvotes":43,"num_comments":3,"created_at":"2026-04-20T12:42:38.889Z"},{"id":"xC7VxRxWI","title":"ShadCN Directory \u2014 Discover, Submit & Share the Best ShadCN UI Resources","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/shadcn-directory-discover-submit-share-the-best-shadcn-ui-resources-xc7vxrxwi","summary":"An open-source directory site for discovering and sharing shadcn/ui ecosystem resources. Users sign in with Google, submit a URL, and OG metadata is auto-fetched before admin approval makes it live. Built with Next.js App Router, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui, MongoDB, and NextAuth. Features a minimal Swiss-style monochrome UI and is released under the MIT license.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--oEE3o3a8--/f_auto/v1771621854/posts/DqfIg6irn?_a=BAMAMiiu0","num_upvotes":6,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-02-23T05:34:16.915Z"},{"id":"JMWgmUBGx","title":"Shadcn Form Builder","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/shadcn-form-builder-jmwgmubgx","summary":"Shadcn Form is a React form library that builds on shadcn/ui and Tailwind CSS, providing modern form-building capabilities. The library is now available on AllShadcn, a component directory for shadcn/ui-based tools.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--3KbCxVTy--/f_auto/v1771328878/posts/JMWgmUBGx?_a=BAMAMiiu0","num_upvotes":13,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-02-17T11:47:58.325Z"},{"id":"AAxVB6DGr","title":"Free open-source animated icon library for React (shadcn compatible)","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/free-open-source-animated-icon-library-for-react-shadcn-compatible--aaxvb6dgr","summary":"AnimateIcons is a free open-source library providing animated SVG icons for React applications. It offers smooth animations powered by motion, integrates with shadcn CLI for easy installation, includes Lucide and Huge icon libraries, and is fully customizable and lightweight. Icons can be installed directly into projects using a simple command.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--TgYejar7--/f_auto/v1771314664/posts/ruEuhKB0y?_a=BAMAMiiu0","num_upvotes":6,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-02-17T11:14:35.372Z"},{"id":"JFGRDS33l","title":"React Wheel Picker","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/react-wheel-picker-jfgrds33l","summary":"React Wheel Picker is a free, open-source component that extends shadcn-ui with an iOS-style wheel picker interface for selecting dates, times, or custom lists. Created by Ch\u00e1nh \u0110\u1ea1i, it's now available on AllShadcn.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--lzRiMTkU--/f_auto/v1771248084/posts/JFGRDS33l?_a=BAMAMiiu0","num_upvotes":9,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-02-16T13:21:24.377Z"},{"id":"KYRzLBmfT","title":"Cover Flow - iOS-Style Cover Flow for React","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/cover-flow---ios-style-cover-flow-for-react-kyrzlbmft","summary":"Cover Flow is a React component library that recreates the iOS-style cover flow interface with fluid animations and zero layout shifts. Built using Motion and Tailwind CSS, it provides a modern implementation of the classic carousel pattern with physical motion effects.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--UAT6R-aR--/f_auto/v1770980733/posts/KYRzLBmfT?_a=BAMAMiiu0","num_upvotes":5,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-02-13T11:05:33.631Z"},{"id":"pVyDuAvAN","title":"Shoogle: Your shadcn Search Engine","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/shoogle-your-shadcn-search-engine-pvyduavan","summary":"Shoogle is a search engine for discovering pre-built shadcn-style components and blocks. It helps developers find ready-made UI components to speed up modern interface development.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--_Y5aKzpC--/f_auto/v1770899048/posts/pVyDuAvAN?_a=BAMAMiiu0","num_upvotes":30,"num_comments":6,"created_at":"2026-02-12T12:24:08.568Z"},{"id":"3VAoa57Hv","title":"Terrae - Beautiful maps made simple","url":"","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/terrae---beautiful-maps-made-simple-3vaoa57hv","summary":"Terrae is a collection of animated, accessible map components built on Mapbox GL and MapLibre GL, styled with Tailwind CSS and compatible with shadcn/ui. The library provides pre-designed, customizable map components for web developers.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--XnLB4xPN--/f_auto/v1770643069/posts/3VAoa57Hv?_a=BAMAMiiu0","num_upvotes":53,"num_comments":4,"created_at":"2026-02-09T13:17:48.876Z"}],"similar_handles":["proflead","game_developers","projectboard","frontend_developer","strapi_io"],"opposite_handles":["felixrieseberg","xai","hamelhusain","hwchase17","skirano"],"similar":[{"id":"837a3817-9e10-4b04-988e-affb8d110d24","handle":"proflead","name":"proflead","is_squad":true,"x":-9.1774,"y":8.8787,"cluster_id":2,"posts_collected":12,"image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--bVL-hyam--/f_auto/v1721402443/squads/837a3817-9e10-4b04-988e-affb8d110d24","features_preview":{"posts_per_week":0.132065,"median_upvotes":1.0,"author_present_share":1.0,"hype_score"